<title>DENMARK: Port conditions update - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>Denmark -</p>
<p>Copenhagen, Jan 20 - At 0900 Copenhagen freeport dockers went to a union meeting at which they decided to do no further work nd went home. They also decided to have a new meeting tomorrow morning at which they will decide whether to resume work. Understand dispute between management and dockers.</p>
<p>PAKISTAN -</p>
<p>Karachi, Jan 19 - 13 vessels waiting off port comprising one general cargo for three days, one container for one day, one rock/phosphate for three days and 10 fertiliser vessels, the first for 19 days. four vessels laid up off port for their own reasons.</p>
</text>
